{
  "description": "Creates a new API key with the specified alias.\n\nKeys are created with granular permissions. Pass `preset` for a named preset\nor `permissions` to list them explicitly; omit both to get the `API` preset.\n\n**Important Security Notice:**\nThe `key_secret` is only returned once at creation time. Store it securely immediately\nas it cannot be retrieved again. If lost, you must delete the key and create a new one.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Create API keys programmatically without UI access\n- Assign meaningful aliases for key identification\n- Scope a key with a named preset or an explicit list of permissions\n- Optionally set an expiry with `expires_at`\n- Keys are immediately active upon creation\n\n**Common Use Cases:**\n- Programmatic key provisioning for CI/CD pipelines\n- Self-serve key generation for team members\n- Automated key rotation workflows\n- Integration with secret management systems\n\n**Required permissions:** `auth:keys:write`. Key presets that include them: `FULL`. See [key permissions](https://fal.ai/docs/documentation/model-apis/authentication/key-based#permissions).",
  "operationId": "createApiKey",
  "requestBody": {
    "content": {
      "application/json": {
        "example": {
          "alias": "Production Key",
          "preset": "API"
        },
        "schema": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "alias": {
              "description": "Required friendly name for the API key",
              "example": "Production Key",
              "maxLength": 255,
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": {
              "description": "Optional description of what the key is for",
              "example": "CI deploy key for the main environment",
              "maxLength": 1000,
              "type": "string"
            },
            "expires_at": {
              "description": "ISO8601 timestamp after which the key stops working",
              "example": "2025-07-15T12:00:00Z",
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "permissions": {
              "description": "Explicit list of permissions to grant instead of a preset. Mutually exclusive with preset.",
              "example": [
                "models:requests:read",
                "models:requests:write"
              ],
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "minItems": 1,
              "type": "array"
            },
            "preset": {
              "description": "Named permission preset to apply. Defaults to \"API\" when neither preset nor permissions is given. Mutually exclusive with permissions.",
              "enum": [
                "FULL",
                "AGENT",
                "API",
                "DEPLOY",
                "READONLY",
                "BILLING",
                "COMPUTE",
                "SERVERLESS"
              ],
              "example": "API",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "alias"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    "required": true
  },
  "responses": {
    "201": {
      "content": {
        "application/json": {
          "example": {
            "key": "abc123def456:sk_live_abc123def456xyz789",
            "key_id": "abc123def456",
            "key_secret": "sk_live_abc123def456xyz789"
          },
          "schema": {
            "description": "Response containing the newly created API key credentials. The key_secret is only returned once.",
            "properties": {
              "key": {
                "description": "Full API key in the format 'key_id:key_secret'. Use this value directly for API authorization. IMPORTANT: This is only returned once at creation time and cannot be retrieved again.",
                "example": "abc123def456:sk_live_abc123...",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "key_id": {
                "description": "Unique identifier for the newly created API key",
                "example": "abc123def456",
                "type": "string"
              },
              "key_secret": {
                "description": "Secret portion of the API key. IMPORTANT: This is only returned once at creation time and cannot be retrieved again.",
                "example": "sk_live_abc123...",
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "key_id",
              "key_secret",
              "key"
            ],
            "type": "object"
          }
        }
      },
      "description": "API key created successfully. Store the key_secret securely - it will not be shown again."
    },
